; The local Datom command contract, not a wire Signal.
; Generate reads the root files of one Nexus together and writes a Rust module
; for each into a directory, named for its file; Check reads and validates them
; whole, writing nothing. A single file is a set of one. Both take the
; namespaces the caller gives, each as an import writes its first segment and
; its ethos files: an import that names a module of one must find each name it
; takes there, and is refused as UnknownName otherwise; an import of any other
; is trusted, and Checked and Generated each list it as an Unchecked finding.
; An open enum a Signal names in its last section that no input or output
; carries is not refused: Checked and Generated each list it as an Unused
; finding. An input or output carries an open enum it reaches, named bare or by
; the file's own namespace, or held through any type the file declares. The
; findings, one list built once for both, go file by file in the order given,
; each file's in the order of its text. A rejection names the file, the line
; and column of the error in it, and the error. Each string is a type for what
; it holds: a file is a FilePath, the directory written into a Directory, a
; namespace a Namespace, a name a Name; the reason a file is unreadable or
; unwritable, a message a person reads, stays a String.
; The files read are of eight roots, each section in this order:
;   Library    [ imports ] [ types ] [ traits ] [ associations ]
;   Signal     [ imports ] [ inputs ] [ outputs ] [ types ] ; or with a fifth, [ open enums ], each generated with its contract module
;   Operation  [ imports ] [ operations ] [ outcomes ] [ types ]   ; proposed, pending the living's word
;   Memory     [ imports ] [ records ] [ changes ] [ answers ] [ types ]
;   Matrix     [ imports ] [ records ]
;   Emission   [ imports ] [ emissions ] [ outcomes ] [ types ]
;   Process    [ imports ] [ processes ] [ types ]
;   Organism   [ receptor ] [ emitter ] [ memory ] [ organs ]   ; pointers, no imports
; A file headed Sema is refused as Renamed.Memory.
Library
[ datom_codec:[ Error ]
  ethos_zero:[ Problem Location ] ]
[ Query.[ Generate.Generation
          Check.Reading ]
  Response.[ Generated.{ ⟦ FilePath ⟧ ⟦ Finding ⟧ }
             Checked.{ ⟦ FilePath ⟧ ⟦ Finding ⟧ }
             Arguments.Integer
             Malformed.Error
             Unreadable.{ FilePath String }
             Rejected.{ FilePath Location Generation_Error }
             Unwritable.{ FilePath String } ]
  Reading.{ ⟦ FilePath ⟧ ⟦ GivenNamespace ⟧ }
  Generation.{ Reading Directory }
  GivenNamespace.{ Namespace ⟦ FilePath ⟧ }
  Finding.[ Unchecked
            Unused.{ FilePath Name } ]
  Unchecked.{ FilePath Namespace ⟦ Name ⟧ }
  FilePath.String
  Directory.String
  Namespace.String
  Name.String
  Generation_Error.[ Structural.protos:Error
                     Conceptual.{ ⟦ Integer ⟧
                                  ethos_zero:Problem } ] ]
[]
[]
